   "subject": "如何讓圖形區分出大小?",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>各位前輩大大</div><div>我是一周的新手~需要用R繪出&quot;eigenvector centrality&quot;</div><div>在網路上拼拼湊湊了幾行code~</div><div>可是繪出來是能用顏色來區分出中心性</div><div>但是如果要用大小來區分~用了degree~結果全部形狀都變成5倍大</div><div>想請問我該如何用形狀大小來區分中心性呢?</div><div><br></div><div>data.txt(65*65 matrix)</div><div><div>     01  <span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>02<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span> 03<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>  04<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>    05~65</div><div>01 31602<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>716<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span> 0<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>  21<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>    5<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span></div><div>02 12745<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>8005 <span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>  0<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>    43<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span></div></div><div>03  0<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>        0<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>10401 7<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>    0<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span><br></div><div>04 820<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>2<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>51<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>  6813   21<br></div><div>05 0<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>        0<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>1207<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>  597    121</div><div>↓</div><div>65</div><div><br></div><div>x=read.table(&quot;data.txt&quot;, header=T)</div><div>dim(x)</div><div>newMat=as.matrix(x)</div><div>mode(newMat) &lt;- &quot;numeric&quot;<br></div><div>net_vec=graph.adjacency(adjmatrix=newMat, mode=&quot;undirected&quot;,weighted=TRUE,diag=FALSE)</div><div>palette &lt;- c(&quot;gray&quot;,&quot;pink&quot;,&quot;green&quot;,&quot;yellow&quot;,&quot;orange&quot;,&quot;red&quot;)</div><div><br></div><div># Eigenvector centrality</div><div>c.e &lt;- evcent(net_vec)$vector</div><div>col &lt;- as.integer(6*(c.e-min(c.e))/diff(range(c.e))+1)<br></div><div>set.seed(1)</div><div>V(net_vec)$size=degree(net_vec)*5<br></div><div>plot.igraph(net_vec, vertex.label=NA, layout=layout.fruchterman.reingold, vertex.color=palette[col], main=&quot;BEA 1997&quot;)</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
