   "subject": "Re: 如何讓圖形區分出大小?",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Jen-Kuan,<div><br></div><div>Please try:</div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-6YVld4jhp1g/Vlg5Yv8MHOI/AAAAAAAAKA4/dk3Y_cKM0uk/s1600/EigenvectorCentrality.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-6YVld4jhp1g/Vlg5Yv8MHOI/AAAAAAAAKA4/dk3Y_cKM0uk/s1600/EigenvectorCentrality.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238133997000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0HY0kdw7Eo_c9108n6zOYt\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-6YVld4jhp1g/Vlg5Yv8MHOI/AAAAAAAAKA4/dk3Y_cKM0uk/s320/EigenvectorCentrality.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"194\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-F5_iI8bVyB4/Vlg5fNeNBmI/AAAAAAAAKBA/_vjsdZwc_8M/s1600/EigenvectorCentrality_output.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-F5_iI8bVyB4/Vlg5fNeNBmI/AAAAAAAAKBA/_vjsdZwc_8M/s1600/EigenvectorCentrality_output.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238133997000&amp;usg=AOvVaw02-7ofTh1y5Ljn8NOeormS\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-F5_iI8bVyB4/Vlg5fNeNBmI/AAAAAAAAKBA/_vjsdZwc_8M/s320/EigenvectorCentrality_output.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"277\" height=\"320\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><div><br></div><div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"># title: Eigenvector centrality in igraph package</font></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"># date: 2015.11.27</font></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\">library(igraph)</font></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\">set.seed(168)</font></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"># create a random dataset with 65*65</font></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\">tmp &lt;- sort(c(0,31602,12745,820,716,8005,2,10401,51,1207,21,43,7,6813,597,5,121))</font></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\">zero.length &lt;- 400</font></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\">ind &lt;- c(rep(0,65*65-zero.length), sample(tmp, zero.length, replace=TRUE))</font></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\">newMat &lt;- matrix(ind[sample(65*65, 65*65, replace=FALSE)], ncol=65)</font></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"># dim(newMat) 65*65</font></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\">net_vec &lt;- graph.adjacency(adjmatrix=newMat, mode=&quot;undirected&quot;,weighted=TRUE,diag=FALSE)</font></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\">palette &lt;- c(&quot;gray&quot;,&quot;pink&quot;,&quot;green&quot;,&quot;yellow&quot;,&quot;orange&quot;,&quot;red&quot;)</font></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"># Eigenvector centrality</font></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\">c.e &lt;- evcent(net_vec)$vector</font></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\">col &lt;- as.integer(6*(c.e-min(c.e))/diff(range(c.e))+1)</font></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"><br></font></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"># V(net_vec)$size &lt;- degree(net_vec)*5</font></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\" color=\"#ff0000\">newmax &lt;- 50</font></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\" color=\"#ff0000\">newmin &lt;- 10</font></div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\" color=\"#ff0000\">V(net_vec)$size &lt;- c.e*(newmax - newmin) + newmin</font></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\">plot.igraph(net_vec, vertex.label=NA, layout=layout.fruchterman.reingold, vertex.color=palette[col], main=&quot;BEA 1997&quot;)</font></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div><font face=\"verdana, sans-serif\"># end</font></div><div><br></div>jen kuan hsuan於 2015年11月24日星期二 UTC+8上午11時34分57秒寫道：</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>各位前輩大大</div><div>我是一周的新手~需要用R繪出&quot;eigenvector centrality&quot;</div><div>在網路上拼拼湊湊了幾行code~</div><div>可是繪出來是能用顏色來區分出中心性</div><div>但是如果要用大小來區分~用了degree~結果全部形狀都變成5倍大</div><div>想請問我該如何用形狀大小來區分中心性呢?</div><div><br></div><div>data.txt(65*65 matrix)</div><div><div>     01  <span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>02<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span> 03<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>  04<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>    05~65</div><div>01 31602<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>716<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span> 0<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>  21<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>    5<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span></div><div>02 12745<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>8005 <span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>  0<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>    43<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span></div></div><div>03  0<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>        0<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>10401 7<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>    0<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span><br></div><div>04 820<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>2<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>51<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>  6813   21<br></div><div>05 0<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>        0<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>1207<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>  597    121</div><div>↓</div><div>65</div><div><br></div><div>x=read.table(&quot;data.txt&quot;, header=T)</div><div>dim(x)</div><div>newMat=as.matrix(x)</div><div>mode(newMat) &lt;- &quot;numeric&quot;<br></div><div>net_vec=graph.adjacency(adjmatrix=newMat, mode=&quot;undirected&quot;,weighted=TRUE,diag=FALSE)</div><div>palette &lt;- c(&quot;gray&quot;,&quot;pink&quot;,&quot;green&quot;,&quot;yellow&quot;,&quot;orange&quot;,&quot;red&quot;)</div><div><br></div><div># Eigenvector centrality</div><div>c.e &lt;- evcent(net_vec)$vector</div><div>col &lt;- as.integer(6*(c.e-min(c.e))/diff(range(c.e))+1)<br></div><div>set.seed(1)</div><div>V(net_vec)$size=degree(net_vec)*5<br></div><div>plot.igraph(net_vec, vertex.label=NA, layout=layout.fruchterman.reingold, vertex.color=palette[col], main=&quot;BEA 1997&quot;)</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
